{%- comment -%}
  Velobiotics BioMatch 2.0 — need-first probiotic finder.
  Data-driven: question flow branches on who/sex/age/life-stage; products are scored against the BioMatch matrix
  (embedded JSON below, generated from biomatch_catalog.json). Lead capture is server-side (biomatchLead):
  Omnisend contact + "biomatch completed" event + Shopify tags + QuizLead record + personalised PDF report.
  Source of truth: Superagent conversation 6aa4e802b36e35ab35f4e2e1 / biomatch/vb-quiz-v2.liquid
{%- endcomment -%}
