obiotics-original-multivitamins-capsules-60s","her-biotics-original-capsules-60s"],"is_hero":false,"sales_units":17}],"needs":[{"code":"gut_bloating","label":"Bloating & gas","emoji":"💨","science_snippet":"Bloating has two usual culprits: gas produced when bacteria ferment undigested food, and meals that move too slowly. Probiotics rebalance the fermenters; enzymes and fibre fix the meal side."},{"code":"gut_irregular","label":"Irregular digestion","emoji":"🔁","science_snippet":"Your bowel rhythm is set by gut bacteria and the fibre they eat. Multi-strain probiotics plus prebiotic fibre are among the best-evidenced ways to steady it."},{"code":"gut_reset","label":"Gut reset","emoji":"🔄","science_snippet":"A single antibiotic course can knock out a third of your gut species for months. Re-seeding with protected live strains and feeding them prebiotic fibre shortens the recovery."},{"code":"immunity","label":"Immunity","emoji":"🛡️","science_snippet":"About 70% of your immune cells sit in and around the gut wall, where they are trained by your bacteria. A diverse, well-fed microbiome is consistently linked to fewer infections."},{"code":"energy","label":"Energy","emoji":"⚡","science_snippet":"Tiredness is frequently a nutrient story: iron, vitamin D and B12 are the usual shortfalls, and a healthy gut lining is what absorbs them. Probiotics have been shown to improve iron uptake."},{"code":"stress_sleep","label":"Stress & sleep","emoji":"😴","science_snippet":"The gut-brain axis runs both ways: stress alters the microbiome, and the microbiome makes about 90% of your serotonin. Adaptogens like ashwagandha and magnesium glycinate lower the stress response so sleep can follow."},{"code":"mood","label":"Mood & focus","emoji":"🌦️","science_snippet":"Gut bacteria produce neurotransmitters and short-chain fatty acids that reach the brain. Trials of multi-strain probiotics show modest but real improvements in mood and mental clarity."},{"code":"weight_loss","label":"Weight loss","emoji":"⚖️","science_snippet":"Gut bacteria influence how many calories you extract from food and how full you feel. Shifting the microbiome, supporting GLP-1 and protecting muscle with protein is the gut-first route to sustainable fat loss."},{"code":"cravings_appetite","label":"Cravings & appetite","emoji":"🍩","science_snippet":"GLP-1, the fullness hormone that injectable weight-loss drugs mimic, is produced by cells in your gut and stimulated by certain bacteria and fibres. Berberine, fibre and protein support it naturally."},{"code":"weight_gain","label":"Healthy weight gain","emoji":"📈","science_snippet":"Under-eating and illness deplete protein within days. Complete nutrition with high-quality protein and probiotics to improve absorption rebuilds weight as muscle, not just fat."},{"code":"skin_hair_nails","label":"Skin, hair & nails","emoji":"✨","science_snippet":"Skin, hair and nails are built from protein, biotin, zinc and vitamins A, C and E — and the gut-skin axis means an inflamed gut shows up as breakouts and dullness. Probiotics calm the gut; collagen and biotin rebuild."},{"code":"joints_bones","label":"Joints & bones","emoji":"🦴","science_snippet":"Bone and joint tissue depend on calcium, magnesium, vitamin D and collagen. Probiotic fermentation produces short-chain fatty acids that measurably increase mineral absorption."},{"code":"intimate_bv","label":"BV & odour","emoji":"🌸","science_snippet":"Bacterial vaginosis happens when protective Lactobacillus decline and vaginal pH rises above 4.5, letting odour-causing bacteria dominate. Boric acid restores acidity fast; daily oral Lactobacillus keeps it there and cuts recurrence."},{"code":"intimate_yeast","label":"Thrush & itching","emoji":"🔥","science_snippet":"Candida is a normal resident that overgrows when Lactobacillus is depleted — often after antibiotics or sugar-heavy weeks. Restoring Lactobacillus dominance is the long-term fix."},{"code":"intimate_uti","label":"UTIs","emoji":"💧","science_snippet":"Around 80% of UTIs are caused by E. coli travelling from the gut. Cranberry proanthocyanidins stop it sticking to the bladder wall, and Lactobacillus keeps the vaginal and urinary flora protective."},{"code":"intimate_daily","label":"Daily intimate balance","emoji":"🛡️","science_snippet":"A Lactobacillus-dominant vaginal microbiome keeps pH acidic and infections rare. Daily oral probiotic strains have been recovered in the vaginal tract — a once-a-day capsule maintains the balance."},{"code":"period_care","label":"Period care","emoji":"🩸","science_snippet":"PMS and cramps respond to magnesium and B6; bloating before a period responds to probiotics. Reusable medical-grade silicone cups avoid the drying and fragrance of many disposables."},{"code":"conception","label":"Conception","emoji":"🌱","science_snippet":"Folate stores take about three months to build and inositol supports regular ovulation. A balanced microbiome is now recognised as part of preconception health for both mum and baby."},{"code":"pregnancy","label":"Pregnancy","emoji":"🤰","science_snippet":"Pregnancy raises the need for folate, iron, choline and DHA and slows digestion. Probiotics in pregnancy ease constipation and are associated with lower rates of eczema in babies."},{"code":"postnatal_breastfeeding","label":"New mum & breastfeeding","emoji":"🍼","science_snippet":"Breastfeeding increases needs for calcium, iron, magnesium and DHA. Breast milk carries probiotic strains that originate in mum's gut, so your microbiome shapes baby's."},{"code":"menopause","label":"Menopause","emoji":"🌿","science_snippet":"As oestrogen falls, the gut \"estrobolome\" and vaginal flora both change, driving hot flushes, sleep disruption and recurrent imbalance. Botanicals, bone minerals and probiotics support the transition."},{"code":"mens_vitality","label":"Men's vitality","emoji":"💪","science_snippet":"Testosterone, energy and recovery depend on zinc, magnesium and vitamin D status — all commonly low in active men. A healthy gut improves absorption of each."},{"code":"mens_daily","label":"Men's daily foundation","emoji":"🧭","science_snippet":"Most men take nothing daily. A multivitamin with live probiotics covers the common gaps and improves how those nutrients are absorbed."},{"code":"kids_gut_immunity","label":"Kids' gut & immunity","emoji":"🧒","science_snippet":"A child's immune system is trained by the gut microbiome. Probiotics reduce antibiotic-associated diarrhoea and, in several trials, the number of sick days from school."},{"code":"kids_picky_eater","label":"Picky eaters","emoji":"🥦","science_snippet":"Selective eaters commonly fall short on fibre, iron and zinc. Probiotics support appetite and digestion, and a complete nutrition shake fills the gaps without a fight."},{"code":"family_daily","label":"Everyday family health","emoji":"👨‍👩‍👧","science_snippet":"Family members share gut bacteria, so one person's imbalance affects the household. A simple daily routine with the right formula for each person is the highest-leverage habit."}]}</script>
<script>
(function(){
  'use strict';
  var root=document.getElementById('vbq'); if(!root) return;
  var FLOW=JSON.parse(document.getElementById('vbq-flow').textContent);
  var DATA=JSON.parse(document.getElementById('vbq-data').textContent);
  var PRODUCTS=DATA.products||[], NEEDS={}; (DATA.needs||[]).forEach(function(n){NEEDS[n.code]=n;});
  var LEAD_ENDPOINT='https://elara-cef2631f.base44.app/functions/biomatchLead';
  var DISCOUNT='BIOMATCH10', VERSION='2.0';
  var view=document.getElementById('vbq-view');
  var S={answers:{}, idx:0, recs:[], lead:null, session:'vbq_'+Date.now().toString(36)+Math.random().toString(36).slice(2,7)};
  var $=function(s,c){return (c||document).querySelector(s);}, $$=function(s,c){return Array.prototype.slice.call((c||document).querySelectorAll(s));};
  function esc(s){return String(s==null?'':s).replace(/[&<>"']/g,function(c){return {'&':'&amp;','<':'&lt;','>':'&gt;','"':'&quot;',"'":'&#39;'}[c];});}
  function track(n,p){try{var d=Object.assign({event:'vb_quiz_'+n,quiz:'biomatch',version:VERSION,session:S.session},p||{});if(window.dataLayer)window.dataLayer.push(d);}catch(e){}}

  /* ---------- dynamic flow ---------- */
  function adult(){return S.answers.who!=='child';}
  function goalGroupsFor(){
    var a=S.answers, out=[];
    Object.keys(FLOW.goal_groups).forEach(function(k){
      var g=FLOW.goal_groups[k], f=g['for']||{};
      if(f.who && f.who.indexOf(a.who)<0) return;
      if(f.sex && f.sex.indexOf(a.sex)<0) return;
      if(f.life_stage && f.life_stage.indexOf(a.life_stage)<0) return;
      if(f.not_life_stage && f.not_life_stage.indexOf(a.life_stage)>=0) return;
      if(k==='kids' && a.who!=='child') return;
      if(a.who==='child' && ['gut','energy','kids'].indexOf(k)<0) return;
      out.push(k);
    });
    /* motherhood/menopause first when relevant */
    out.sort(function(x,y){var pri={mother:0,menopause:0,kids:0};return (pri[x]===undefined?1:0)-(pri[y]===undefined?1:0);});
    return out;
  }
  function steps(){
    var a=S.answers, st=['who'];
    if(a.who!=='child') st.push('sex');
    st.push('age');
    if(a.who!=='child' && a.sex==='female' && a.age && a.age!=='60_plus' && (a.who==='myself'||a.who==='partner')) st.push('life_stage');
    if(a.who==='child'){ /* child: goal is implicit */ }
    else st.push('goal');
    st.push('focus','urgency','lead','loading','results');
    return st;
  }
  function phaseOf(step){return {who:0,sex:0,age:0,life_stage:0,goal:1,focus:2,urgency:3,lead:4,loading:4,results:4}[step];}
  function questionSteps(){return steps().filter(function(s){return ['lead','loading','results'].indexOf(s)<0;});}
  function cur(){return steps()[S.idx];}

  /* ---------- UI helpers ---------- */
  function opt(val,emoji,title,sub,on){
    return '<button type="button" class="vbq__opt'+(on?' is-on':'')+'" data-val="'+esc(val)+'"><span class="vbq__opt-ico">'+emoji+'</span><span><span class="vbq__opt-t">'+esc(title)+'</span>'+(sub?'<span class="vbq__opt-s">'+esc(sub)+'</span>':'')+'</span><span class="vbq__opt-chk"></span></button>';
  }
  function q(label,h,help,optsHtml,extra){
    return '<section class="vbq__stage"><div class="vbq__card"><span class="vbq__qlabel">'+label+'</span><h2 class="vbq__h vbq__serif">'+h+'</h2><p class="vbq__help">'+help+'</p><div class="vbq__opts'+(extra&&extra.cols===3?' is-3':'')+'" id="vbq-opts">'+optsHtml+'</div><div id="vbq-react"></div><div class="vbq__nav"><button type="button" class="vbq__back" id="vbq-back">← Back</button><button type="button" class="vbq__next" id="vbq-next" disabled>Continue</button></div>'+(extra&&extra.hint?'<p class="vbq__hint">'+extra.hint+'</p>':'')+'</div></section>';
  }
  var REACT={
    who:{myself:'Perfect — this is all about you.',partner:'Lovely. We\'ll build this around them, not you.',child:'Great — we\'ll only show formulas made for children.',family:'One routine for the whole house — let\'s do it.'},
    sex:{female:'Got it. Our women\'s range is our most-reviewed — 400+ verified reviews.',male:'Noted — His-Biotics and the core range only. No women\'s-health questions coming.',unspecified:'No problem — we\'ll keep to the unisex range.'},
    life_stage:{pregnant:'Congratulations. We automatically leave out anything not suited to pregnancy.',trying_to_conceive:'Exciting. Gut health is part of the preconception picture.',postnatal:'You\'re doing brilliantly. Recovery and energy first.',menopause:'This is a time when the microbiome shifts a lot — good that you\'re here.',none:'Great, thanks.'},
    urgency:{now:'Understood — fast-acting first, then something to keep it away.',recurring:'Breaking the cycle is exactly what daily probiotics are for.',optimise:'Love it. Prevention is the best medicine.'}
  };

  /* ---------- render ---------- */
  function render(){
    var step=cur(); var a=S.answers;
    root.classList.toggle('is-quiz', step!=='start');
    /* progress */
    var qs=questionSteps(), qi=qs.indexOf(step), ph=phaseOf(step);
    $$('.vbq__dot').forEach(function(d){var p=+d.dataset.phase; d.classList.toggle('is-done',p<ph); d.classList.toggle('is-on',p===ph);});
    var fill=$('#vbq-dots-fill'); if(fill) fill.style.width=(ph/4*100)+'%';
    var qc=$('#vbq-qcount'); if(qc) qc.innerHTML = qi>=0 ? 'Question <b>'+(qi+1)+'</b> of <b>'+qs.length+'</b>' : (step==='lead'?'Last step — where should we send your report?':'');
    var html='';
    if(step==='who'){
      html=q('Question 1','Who is this <span class="vbq__hl">for?</span>','We tailor every question and recommendation to the right person.',
        opt('myself','🙋','Myself','',a.who==='myself')+opt('partner','💑','My partner','',a.who==='partner')+opt('child','🧒','My child','Ages 3 – 17',a.who==='child')+opt('family','👨‍👩‍👧','Whole family','One routine for everyone',a.who==='family'));
    } else if(step==='sex'){
      var who=a.who==='partner'?'their':'your';
      html=q('About '+(a.who==='partner'?'them':'you'),'What is '+who+' <span class="vbq__hl">biological sex?</span>','Some formulas are body-specific (intimate health, men\'s vitality, pregnancy). We honour all identities — biology guides the science.',
        opt('female','♀️','Female','',a.sex==='female')+opt('male','♂️','Male','',a.sex==='male')+opt('unspecified','✨','Prefer not to say','Unisex range only',a.sex==='unspecified'));
    } else if(step==='age'){
      var list=a.who==='child'?FLOW.age_child:FLOW.age_adult;
      html=q('About '+(a.who==='myself'?'you':'them'),'Which <span class="vbq__hl">age range?</span>','Nutritional needs shift with every life stage — this changes what we recommend.',
        list.map(function(o){return opt(o[0],o[1],o[2],'',a.age===o[0]);}).join(''));
    } else if(step==='life_stage'){
      var ls=FLOW.life_stage.filter(function(o){return !(o[0]==='menopause' && a.age==='18_30');});
      html=q('About '+(a.who==='myself'?'you':'them'),'Does any of this <span class="vbq__hl">apply right now?</span>','This matters for safety — some ingredients are not suitable during pregnancy or while breastfeeding.',
        ls.map(function(o){return opt(o[0],o[1],o[2],'',a.life_stage===o[0]);}).join(''));
    } else if(step==='goal'){
      var gs=goalGroupsFor();
      html=q('Your goal','What would you most like to <span class="vbq__hl">improve?</span>','Pick your main goal — you can add a second one on the next screen if you like.',
        gs.map(function(k){var g=FLOW.goal_groups[k];return opt(k,g.emoji,g.label,'',a.goal===k);}).join(''),{cols:gs.length>6?3:2});
    } else if(step==='focus'){
      var gk=a.who==='child'?'kids':a.goal; var fo=FLOW.focus_options[gk]||FLOW.focus_options.gut;
      if(gk==='mother' && a.life_stage){ fo=fo.filter(function(o){return (a.life_stage==='pregnant'&&o[0]==='pregnancy')||(a.life_stage==='trying_to_conceive'&&o[0]==='conception')||(a.life_stage==='postnatal'&&o[0]==='postnatal_breastfeeding');}); if(!fo.length) fo=FLOW.focus_options.mother; }
      var title=a.who==='child'?'What matters most for <span class="vbq__hl">your child?</span>':'Let\'s get <span class="vbq__hl">specific.</span>';
      html=q('Your focus',title,'The more precise you are, the better the match. Choose the one that fits best.',
        fo.map(function(o,i){return opt(o[0]+'|'+i,o[1],o[2],o[3],a.focus_key===o[0]+'|'+i);}).join(''));
    } else if(step==='urgency'){
      html=q('Urgency','How <span class="vbq__hl">urgent</span> is this?','This decides whether we lead with fast relief, a prevention routine, or a complete stack.',
        FLOW.urgency.map(function(o){return opt(o[0],o[1],o[2],o[3],a.urgency===o[0]);}).join(''),{cols:3});
    } else if(step==='lead'){
      S.recs=recommend();
      var top=S.recs[0]?byHandle(S.recs[0].handle):null;
      html='<section class="vbq__stage"><div class="vbq__card vbq__lead"><span class="vbq__qlabel">Your match is ready</span><h2 class="vbq__h vbq__serif">Where should we send <span class="vbq__hl">your report?</span></h2>'+
        '<p class="vbq__help">We\'ve matched '+(a.who==='myself'?'you':'them')+' to <b>'+esc(top?top.title:'a Velobiotics formula')+'</b>. Enter your email to see the full stack, get your 10% code and a personalised 4-page report written by our doctors.</p>'+
        '<div class="vbq__prev"><div><b>📄</b>4-page report</div><div><b>🎁</b>10% code</div><div><b>📬</b>3 short emails</div></div>'+
        '<form id="vbq-lead" novalidate><div class="vbq__field"><label for="vbq-email">Email address</label><input class="vbq__input" type="email" id="vbq-email" required autocomplete="email" inputmode="email" placeholder="you@example.com" value="'+esc(a.email||'')+'"></div>'+
        '<div class="vbq__field"><label for="vbq-name">First name <span style="font-weight:400">(so the report speaks to you)</span></label><input class="vbq__input" type="text" id="vbq-name" autocomplete="given-name" placeholder="e.g. Sarah" value="'+esc(a.name||'')+'"></div>'+
        '<button type="submit" class="vbq__next" style="width:100%" id="vbq-lead-btn">Show my results &amp; 10% code →</button>'+
        '<p class="vbq__legal" id="vbq-lead-err" style="color:#b00020;display:none">Please enter a valid email address.</p>'+
        '<p class="vbq__legal">🔒 No spam. Unsubscribe anytime. <a href="/policies/privacy-policy">Privacy policy</a>.</p></form>'+
        '<div class="vbq__nav" style="margin-top:6px"><button type="button" class="vbq__back" id="vbq-back">← Back</button></div></div></section>';
    } else if(step==='loading'){
      html='<section class="vbq__stage"><div class="vbq__loader"><div class="vbq__ring"></div><h2 class="vbq__h vbq__serif" style="font-size:28px">Building your <span class="vbq__hl">stack…</span></h2><ul class="vbq__check" id="vbq-check"><li>Reading your profile</li><li>Screening '+PRODUCTS.length+' formulas for safety</li><li>Scoring strains against your focus</li><li>Writing your personalised report</li></ul></div></section>';
    } else if(step==='results'){
      html=resultsHtml();
    }
    if(step!=='start'){ view.innerHTML=html; }
    window.scrollTo({top:0,behavior:'smooth'});
    bind(step);
    if(step==='loading') runLoader();
  }
  function bind(step){
    var back=$('#vbq-back'); if(back) back.onclick=prev;
    var next=$('#vbq-next'); if(next) next.onclick=advance;
    var form=$('#vbq-lead'); if(form) form.onsubmit=function(e){e.preventDefault();submitLead();};
    $$('#vbq-opts .vbq__opt').forEach(function(b){ b.onclick=function(){ choose(step,b); }; });
  }
  function choose(step,b){
    var val=b.dataset.val;
    $$('#vbq-opts .vbq__opt').forEach(function(o){o.classList.remove('is-on');}); b.classList.add('is-on');
    if(step==='focus'){ var parts=val.split('|'); S.answers.focus=parts[0]; S.answers.focus_key=val; var gk=S.answers.who==='child'?'kids':S.answers.goal; var o=(FLOW.focus_options[gk]||[])[+parts[1]]; S.answers.focus_label=o?o[2]:parts[0]; }
    else S.answers[step]=val;
    if(step==='who'&&val==='child'){ S.answers.sex='unspecified'; }
    if(step==='who'&&val!=='child'&&S.answers.sex==='unspecified'&&!S.answers._sexChosen){ delete S.answers.sex; }
    if(step==='sex') S.answers._sexChosen=true;
    if(step==='goal'){ delete S.answers.focus; delete S.answers.focus_key; }
    var r=$('#vbq-react'); var msg=(REACT[step]||{})[val]; if(r) r.innerHTML=msg?'<div class="vbq__react">'+esc(msg)+'</div>':'';
    var n=$('#vbq-next'); if(n) n.disabled=false;
    track('answer',{step:step,value:val});
    clearTimeout(S._auto); S._auto=setTimeout(advance, msg?900:380);
  }
  function advance(){ clearTimeout(S._auto); if(!S.answers[cur()] && cur()!=='focus') return; if(cur()==='focus'&&!S.answers.focus) return; S.idx=Math.min(S.idx+1, steps().length-1); render(); track('step',{step:cur()}); }
  function prev(){ clearTimeout(S._auto); if(S.idx>0){ S.idx--; render(); } else { exit(); } }
  function start(){ S.idx=0; S.answers={}; root.classList.add('is-quiz'); track('started',{}); render(); }
  function exit(){ if(S.idx>0 && !window.confirm('Leave the BioMatch? Your answers will be lost.')) return; location.href='/'; }

  /* ---------- scoring ---------- */
  function byHandle(h){ for(var i=0;i<PRODUCTS.length;i++) if(PRODUCTS[i].handle===h) return PRODUCTS[i]; return null; }
  function ageNum(){ return {'3_6':4,'7_12':9,'13_17':15,'18_30':24,'30_45':37,'45_60':52,'60_plus':65}[S.answers.age]||30; }
  function allowed(p){
    var a=S.answers, au=p.audience||{}, age=ageNum();
    if(au.sex && au.sex!=='any' && au.sex!==a.sex) return false;
    if(a.sex==='unspecified' && au.sex && au.sex!=='any') return false;
    if(au.min_age!=null && age<au.min_age) return false;
    if(au.max_age!=null && age>au.max_age) return false;
    var ls=a.life_stage&&a.life_stage!=='none'?a.life_stage:null;
    if(ls && (au.exclude_life_stage||[]).indexOf(ls)>=0) return false;
    if(!ls && (au.life_stage||[]).length && (au.life_stage||[]).indexOf('none')<0 && a.goal!=='mother') return false;
    if(a.who==='child' && au.min_age!=null && au.min_age>=18) return false;
    if(a.who!=='child' && au.max_age!=null && au.max_age<18) return false;
    return true;
  }
  function userNeeds(){
    var a=S.answers, w={}; var gk=a.who==='child'?'kids':a.goal; var g=FLOW.goal_groups[gk]||FLOW.goal_groups.gut;
    (g.codes||[]).forEach(function(c){ w[c]=Math.max(w[c]||0,0.6); });
    if(a.focus) w[a.focus]=Math.max(w[a.focus]||0,4);
    if(a.life_stage==='pregnant') w.pregnancy=Math.max(w.pregnancy||0,2);
    if(a.life_stage==='trying_to_conceive') w.conception=Math.max(w.conception||0,2);
    if(a.life_stage==='postnatal') w.postnatal_breastfeeding=Math.max(w.postnatal_breastfeeding||0,2);
    if(a.life_stage==='menopause') w.menopause=Math.max(w.menopause||0,1.5);
    if(a.sex==='male'){ w.mens_daily=Math.max(w.mens_daily||0,.8); }
    return w;
  }
  function score(p,w){
    var s=0, hit=0; (p.needs||[]).forEach(function(n){ if(w[n.code]){ s+=w[n.code]*n.w; hit++; } });
    if(!hit) return 0;
    var a=S.answers;
    if(a.urgency==='now'){ if(p.form==='suppository'||p.form==='kit') s*=1.4; if(p.is_bundle) s*=1.05; }
    if(a.urgency==='recurring'){ if(p.form==='capsules'||p.form==='chewable') s*=1.15; if(p.is_bundle) s*=1.1; }
    if(a.urgency==='optimise'){ if(p.is_bundle) s*=.85; if(p.form==='suppository') s*=.8; }
    if(p.is_hero) s*=1.08;
    if(p.form==='accessory') s*=.3;
    s*=1+Math.min(0.15,(p.sales_units||0)/1500);
    return s;
  }
  function recommend(){
    var w=userNeeds(); var scored=PRODUCTS.filter(allowed).map(function(p){return {handle:p.handle,score:score(p,w),p:p};}).filter(function(x){return x.score>0;}).sort(function(x,y){return y.score-x.score;});
    if(!scored.length){ scored=PRODUCTS.filter(allowed).filter(function(p){return p.is_hero;}).map(function(p){return {handle:p.handle,score:1,p:p};}); }
    var out=[], singles=scored.filter(function(x){return !x.p.is_bundle;}), bundles=scored.filter(function(x){return x.p.is_bundle;});
    if(singles[0]) out.push(singles[0]);
    for(var i=1;i<singles.length&&out.length<2;i++){ if(singles[i].p.form!==out[0].p.form || singles[i].p.brand!==out[0].p.brand) out.push(singles[i]); }
    var b=bundles.filter(function(x){return (x.p.bundle_of||[]).indexOf(out[0]?out[0].handle:'')>=0;})[0]||bundles[0];
    if(b) out.push(b); 
    for(var j=0;j<singles.length&&out.length<3;j++){ if(out.indexOf(singles[j])<0) out.push(singles[j]); }
    var max=out[0]?out[0].score:1;
    return out.slice(0,3).map(function(x,i){ return {handle:x.handle,score:x.score,fit:Math.round(Math.min(98,Math.max(64,70+28*(x.score/max)-(i*2)))),role:i===0?'Best match':(x.p.is_bundle?'Complete stack':'Supporting')}; });
  }

  /* ---------- lead + results ---------- */
  function submitLead(){
    var email=($('#vbq-email').value||'').trim(), name=($('#vbq-name').value||'').trim(); var err=$('#vbq-lead-err');
    if(!/^[^@\s]+@[^@\s]+\.[^@\s]+$/.test(email)){ if(err) err.style.display='block'; return; }
    S.answers.email=email; S.answers.name=name; var btn=$('#vbq-lead-btn'); if(btn){btn.disabled=true;btn.textContent='Building your stack…';}
    var recs=S.recs.map(function(r){var p=byHandle(r.handle)||{};return {handle:r.handle,title:p.title,brand:p.brand,image:p.img,price:p.price_usd,why:p.why_copy,fit:r.fit,role:r.role};});
    var a=S.answers, need=NEEDS[a.focus]||{};
    var payload={email:email,name:name,version:VERSION,answers:{who:a.who,sex:a.sex,age:a.age,life_stage:a.life_stage||'none',goal:a.who==='child'?'kids':a.goal,focus:a.focus,focus_label:a.focus_label,urgency:a.urgency},recs:recs,discountCode:DISCOUNT,need_label:need.label||a.focus_label,session:S.session,page:location.href};
    S.idx=steps().indexOf('loading'); render();
    var ctl=('AbortController' in window)?new AbortController():null; if(ctl) setTimeout(function(){ctl.abort();},12000);
    fetch(LEAD_ENDPOINT,{method:'POST',headers:{'Content-Type':'application/json'},body:JSON.stringify(payload),signal:ctl?ctl.signal:undefined,keepalive:true})
      .then(function(r){return r.json();}).then(function(j){ S.lead=j; console.log('[VBQ] lead',j&&j.ok); }).catch(function(e){ console.warn('[VBQ] lead endpoint',e); S.lead={ok:false}; })
      .then(function(){ S._leadDone=true; if(S._loaderDone) showResults(); });
    track('lead',{focus:a.focus});
  }
  function runLoader(){
    var items=$$('#vbq-check li'); var i=0; S._loaderDone=false;
    var t=setInterval(function(){ if(items[i]) items[i].classList.add('is-on'); i++; if(i>items.length){ clearInterval(t); S._loaderDone=true; if(S._leadDone) showResults(); else setTimeout(function(){ if(!S._leadDone){ S._leadDone=true; showResults(); } },6000); } },650);
  }
  function showResults(){ S.idx=steps().indexOf('results'); render(); track('results',{top:S.recs[0]&&S.recs[0].handle}); }
  function resultsHtml(){
    var a=S.answers, name=a.name||'There', lead=S.lead||{}; var who=a.who==='myself'?'your':'their';
    var chips=[]; if(a.who) chips.push('<b>For:</b> '+esc({myself:'Myself',partner:'My partner',child:'My child',family:'Whole family'}[a.who]));
    if(a.sex&&a.sex!=='unspecified') chips.push('<b>Sex:</b> '+esc(a.sex==='female'?'Female':'Male')); if(a.age) chips.push('<b>Age:</b> '+esc(a.age.replace('_',' – ').replace('plus','+')));
    if(a.life_stage&&a.life_stage!=='none') chips.push('<b>Stage:</b> '+esc(a.life_stage.replace(/_/g,' '))); if(a.focus_label) chips.push('<b>Focus:</b> '+esc(a.focus_label)); if(a.urgency) chips.push('<b>Urgency:</b> '+esc({now:'Relief now',recurring:'Stop it recurring',optimise:'Optimising'}[a.urgency]));
    var need=NEEDS[a.focus]||{};
    var report = lead.report_url ? '<div class="vbq__report"><div class="vbq__report-ico"></div><div><h3>'+esc(name)+', your personalised report is ready</h3><p>Four pages on <b>'+esc(need.label||a.focus_label||'your goal')+'</b>: what\'s going on, what the science says, a 4-week plan and '+who+' matched stack. We\'ve also emailed it to <b>'+esc(a.email)+'</b>.</p><div class="vbq__report-btns"><a class="vbq__rbtn" href="'+esc(lead.pdf_url||lead.report_url)+'" target="_blank" rel="noopener">📄 Download the PDF</a><a class="vbq__rbtn vbq__rbtn--ghost" href="'+esc(lead.report_url)+'" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Read online</a></div></div></div>'
      : '<div class="vbq__report"><div class="vbq__report-ico"></div><div><h3>'+esc(name)+', your report is on its way</h3><p>We\'re emailing your personalised 4-page BioMatch report to <b>'+esc(a.email)+'</b> — give it a minute or two.</p></div></div>';
    var recs=S.recs.map(function(r,i){ var p=byHandle(r.handle)||{}; var utm='?utm_source=quiz&utm_medium=recommendation&utm_campaign=biomatch&utm_content='+encodeURIComponent(r.handle)+'&utm_term=rank-'+(i+1);
      var shop='/discount/'+DISCOUNT+'?redirect='+encodeURIComponent('/products/'+r.handle+utm);
      return '<article class="vbq__rec'+(i===0?' is-top':'')+'"><span class="vbq__rank">'+(i===0?'★ ':'')+esc(r.role)+'</span><div class="vbq__rec-img"><img src="'+esc(p.img||'')+'" alt="'+esc(p.title||'')+'" loading="lazy"></div><div><div class="vbq__rec-brand">'+esc(p.brand||'Velobiotics')+'</div><h3 class="vbq__rec-title vbq__serif">'+esc(p.title||r.handle)+'</h3><p class="vbq__rec-why">'+esc(p.why_copy||'')+'</p>'+
        (p.key_ingredients&&p.key_ingredients.length?'<p class="vbq__rec-ing"><b>Inside:</b> '+esc(p.key_ingredients.slice(0,4).join(' · '))+'</p>':'')+
        '<div class="vbq__rec-fit"><span>Match</span><div class="vbq__fitbar"><i style="width:'+r.fit+'%"></i></div><b>'+r.fit+'%</b></div>'+
        '<a class="vbq__rec-cta" href="'+shop+'">Shop with 10% off →</a><a class="vbq__rec-cta2" href="/products/'+esc(r.handle)+utm+'">Learn more</a></div></article>'; }).join('');
    return '<section class="vbq__res"><div class="vbq__card"><span class="vbq__qlabel">Your BioMatch results</span><h2 class="vbq__h vbq__serif">'+esc(name)+', here\'s '+who+' <span class="vbq__hl">personalised stack.</span></h2><div class="vbq__chips">'+chips.map(function(c){return '<span class="vbq__chip">'+c+'</span>';}).join('')+'</div>'+report+
      '<div class="vbq__code"><span class="vbq__code-l">Your 10% code</span><span class="vbq__code-v">'+DISCOUNT+'</span><span class="vbq__code-r">Applied automatically when you tap “Shop with 10% off”. One use per customer.</span></div>'+
      '<div class="vbq__recs">'+recs+'</div>'+
      (need.science_snippet?'<div class="vbq__react" style="margin-top:22px"><b>Why probiotics for '+esc(need.label||'this')+'?</b> '+esc(need.science_snippet)+'</div>':'')+
      '<div class="vbq__share"><span>Share your BioMatch</span><br><a id="vbq-wa">📱 WhatsApp</a><a id="vbq-copy">🔗 Copy link</a><a id="vbq-retake">↻ Retake</a></div></div></section>';
  }
  view.addEventListener('click',function(e){
    var t=e.target.closest('a'); if(!t) return;
    if(t.id==='vbq-wa'){ e.preventDefault(); window.open('https://wa.me/?text='+encodeURIComponent('I just took the Velobiotics BioMatch and got my personalised probiotic plan: '+location.origin+'/pages/quiz'),'_blank'); }
    if(t.id==='vbq-copy'){ e.preventDefault(); try{navigator.clipboard.writeText(location.origin+'/pages/quiz'); t.textContent='✓ Copied';}catch(err){} }
    if(t.id==='vbq-retake'){ e.preventDefault(); start(); }
    if(t.classList.contains('vbq__rec-cta')){ track('rec_click',{href:t.getAttribute('href')}); }
  });
  var startBtn=document.getElementById('vbq-start'); if(startBtn) startBtn.addEventListener('click',start);
  var exitBtn=document.getElementById('vbq-exit'); if(exitBtn) exitBtn.addEventListener('click',exit);
  window.VBQ={state:S,recommend:recommend,start:start,steps:steps};
  console.log('[VBQ] BioMatch '+VERSION+' ready — '+PRODUCTS.length+' products, '+Object.keys(NEEDS).length+' needs');
})();
</script>

